The public source does not contain game-derived fonts, atlas pixels or collectible
tables. The executable embeds compact collectible positions. The accompanying
locale packs contain native item names, collectible icons and subset font artwork
derived from the owned game (Rodin bold and the native Chinese/Korean faces).
Those assets are not MIT licensed; all rights remain with their respective rights
holders. These compact packs are required at runtime; whole font and Mals archives
